  "description": "The SCOTT Strike 20 delivers capable, controlled E-Bike performance in a build that's thoughtfully priced without feeling like a compromise. Engineered for power, precision, and confidence across all trails, this 150mm full-suspension alloy 29er combines substantial ride capacity with handling that inspires trust from the first pedal stroke. At its core lies Bosch's Performance CX motor, delivering up to 120Nm of torque and 750W peak output that translates smoothly into controlled, reliable power across every trail condition. Paired with an 800Wh removable battery, the bike significantly extends your range and reduces fatigue on longer rides—giving you the freedom to explore further and stay out longer.\n\nShimano's Deore 12-speed drivetrain delivers smooth, dependable shifts across techy singletrack and expansive alpine passes with equal confidence. Fox suspension, with our proprietary kinematics and lockout feature, absorbs trail chatter and bigger impacts, keeping the ride composed and the rider in control across all terrain. And completing the build, making it a ride that’s as ready for the real world as it is for the trail, are integrated front and rear lights, a kickstand, and frame mounting points.\n\nPersonalization at your fingertips with fully adjustable riding modes via the Intuvia 200 display and Bosch App. Whether you're managing power, pacing your range, or adapting to a change in terrain, you have the control to make the most of each ride. The result is a bike that makes every ride feel effortlessly right.\n\nA capable alloy frame and a well-considered component spec come together in a package that's enjoyable to ride, straightforward to maintain, and built to go the distance—on every trail and every adventure along the way.\n\nPlease note that bike specifications are subject to change without prior notice.",
